+
+There is no projection-to-physics path. The only control path is the existing explicit paired actuator command. Human behavior may differ when information differs; the apparatus neither compensates nor supplies a policy.
+
+## Exact coordinate and identity contract
+
+`operator_view.KEPT` is raw indices 0–9 and 14–28. CHEMISTRY-HIDDEN rows contain the actual selected 25 values in their original order. Raw indices 10–13 are absent from current and every historical row. The condition label is explicit; omitted channels have no numeric slot or derived summary. FULL-RAW returns a validated copy of the complete original schema-1 payload.
