+
+## Surface-by-surface evidence
+
+| Surface | Construction and check |
+|---|---|
+| Physical chemistry/transduction | P files and configuration unchanged; real four chemistry values retained; manufactured paired histories/final state identical |
+| Current and historical operator values | All rows projected server-side; exact schema/label/width checked; chemistry canary and extra raw-coordinate mutations rejected |
