+
+The permitted channels can naturally carry lawful information correlated with the environment. This correction removes direct chemistry coordinates and prohibited extras; it does not destroy lawful contact/light/proprioception/E/I evidence or human memory. An operator who manually types information into their own notes is not a new privileged server channel.
