+`Run.sensor` and `sensor.jsonl.gz` retain the full raw history. Native/wave/event records and complete snapshots retain physical truth. The final `sensor-display.json` and human controller input records preserve what the operator could see. `operator.jsonl.gz` is a private lifecycle/display-hash audit; it is never served. `validators.verify_segment` independently validates raw physical rows and the declared projected rows. The new paired manufactured test checks nonzero real chemistry in the raw record as well as full equality across display conditions.
